# Trial-Size Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_earth): the win's arms with Titan known and a Scroll of
# Instant Warp held. A level 20 Summoner with the quest accepted, the Mini Tuning Fork of Earth, Titan (spell 299) and the
# scroll: the win: onEventFinishWin: hasSpell: no teach; hasItem: no scroll; fame, completeQuest.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Bastok.TrialSizeTrialByEarth accepted
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfEarth
item ScrollOfInstantWarp
spell 299
login
trade EP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfEarth x1  # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                  # arena 1: entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill GALGALIM+3                         # WON; 32001
finish                                  # Titan known, the scroll held: only fame and completeQuest
